<title>USA: Drew Industries sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Drew Industries sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Drew Industries Inc said Thursday it has set a two-for-one stock split that will be in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock split is effective March 21 to stockholders of record as of March 4.</p>
<p>Drew currently has 5,767,000 shares outstanding. After the stock split, as well as its plan to buy back 800,000 shares of Chairman Edward Rose's stock, the company will have 9,752,000 shares outstanding.</p>
